page('index.html',('HU-MCD：结果与证据','HU-MCD: findings and evidence'),body)
body=p('这是对已发布实现的固定配置复现，还不是独立重写。每类固定 400 张训练、50 张验证图片；输入、权重和执行版本可追溯。','This is a fixed-configuration reproduction of the released implementation, not an independent rewrite. Each class has fixed lists of 400 training and 50 validation images, with traceable inputs, weights and execution versions.','lead')+h('十类概念发现','Ten-class concept discovery')+p('cluster 是初始聚类，学习概念是过滤后拟合的子空间；补空间单列，不计入学习概念。completeness 表示分类权重覆盖度，不是概念纯度。','Clusters are initial groups; learned concepts are fitted subspaces retained after filtering. The complement is separate. Completeness measures classifier-weight coverage, not semantic purity.')
