body+=table([('类别','Class'),('初始 → 学习','Initial → learned'),('过滤','Filtered'),('Completeness','Completeness'),('论文：数量 / 覆盖度¹','Paper: count / completeness¹'),('状态','Status')],data)+p('¹ 补充 Table 2 的覆盖度只有两位小数，不是精确匹配目标。','¹ Supplement Table 2 rounds completeness to two decimals; these are not exact targets.','quiet')+figure('hub/figures/ten-class.png','数量相近不代表同编号概念语义相同。类别链接包含全部概念和补空间。','Similar counts do not imply semantic correspondence. Class links include every concept and the complement.')+h('预测影响：插入与删除','Prediction impact: insertion and deletion')+p('C-Insertion 逐步显示所选区域；C-Deletion 逐步移除区域。HU-MCD 按每张图的局部概念重要性排序，不等同于概念页的全局重要性。','C-Insertion progressively reveals selected regions; C-Deletion removes them. HU-MCD uses a per-image local ranking, distinct from global importance on concept pages.')+figure('hub/figures/ten-evaluation.png','500 张图原始轨迹汇总；保留贡献人数大于 375 的原规则点。没有补端点或平滑，连接线仅供阅读。','Raw trajectories pooled over 500 images; original-rule points with more than 375 contributors. No endpoint completion or smoothing; lines are visual guides.')+p('未扰动准确率 82.4%。首个概念区域删除 / 插入为 36.0% / 62.6%；Random 相邻实际网格约 22.85–23.84% 像素，对应约 76.0–75.4% / 20.8–23.2%。这是邻近预算的描述性比较，不是匹配预算统计检验。','Unperturbed accuracy is 82.4%. The first concept region gives deletion / insertion accuracy of 36.0% / 62.6%; nearby Random grid points use about 22.85–23.84% of pixels and give about 76.0–75.4% / 20.8–23.2%. This is descriptive proximity, not a matched-budget test.')
