body=p('本支线检验轻微改变掩码边界后，片段是否仍分到原概念。没有人工参考掩码，因此不能回答 SAM 分割是否准确。','This track tests whether small mask-boundary changes preserve concept assignments. Without human reference masks, it cannot establish SAM segmentation accuracy.','lead')+table([('条件','Condition'),('已验收类别','Accepted classes'),('平均保留率','Mean retention')],[[bi('原掩码','Identity'),'10 / 10','1.0000'],[bi('腐蚀 1 像素','Erode 1 pixel'),'10 / 10','0.7825'],[bi('腐蚀 2 像素','Erode 2 pixels'),'6 / 10','0.6908'],[bi('膨胀 1 像素','Dilate 1 pixel'),'6 / 10','0.8041'],[bi('膨胀 2 像素','Dilate 2 pixels'),'6 / 10','0.7352']])+p('先在每张图的有效基准片段上求保留率，再类内平均、已验收类别等权平均。后三个条件的类别分母不同，不能视为同一总体的强弱排序。','Retention is computed over valid baseline regions per image, averaged within class, then equally across accepted classes. The last three conditions have different class denominators and cannot be ranked as the same population.','quiet')+figure('hub/figures/robustness.png','每行一个类别、每列一种边界扰动；数值为原分配保留率。灰格／—是未验收结果，不是零。','Rows are classes, columns are boundary changes, and percentages are assignment retention. Grey / — means no accepted result, not zero.')+h('为什么四类只有部分结果','Why four classes are partial')+p('Airliner、Hummingbird、Container Ship、Beach Wagon 在腐蚀 2 像素阶段触发一致性检查：空片段令 batch8 缩到 7，未改变的对照特征最大绝对差约 0.000450–0.001063。28 个已检查对照的最终分配不变，但容差门限未通过。','Airliner, Hummingbird, Container Ship and Beach Wagon triggered the consistency gate during 2-pixel erosion. Empty regions reduced batch8 to seven; unchanged controls differed by about 0.000450–0.001063 in maximum absolute feature value. All 28 inspected control assignments stayed unchanged, but the tolerance gate failed.')+p('可能与 batch 形状下浮点运算有关，机制尚未证明。未放宽门限或自动重提。已完成 21,823 / 28,435 个片段条件，余下 6,612 个不能记为成功。','Batch-shape-dependent floating-point arithmetic is a possible explanation, not a proven mechanism. No gate relaxation or automatic retry. 21,823 of 28,435 region-condition records completed; 6,612 cannot be counted as successful.','note')
