body=p('这是项目扩展，不是论文原有实验。当前链条是皮肤影像分类器 → 源域概念发现 → 冻结概念迁移到外部病例。各阶段的工程通过不等于临床验证。','This is a project extension, not an original paper experiment: skin-image classifier → source concept discovery → frozen-concept transfer. Engineering acceptance is not clinical validation.','lead')+table([('阶段','Stage'),('已完成','Completed'),('尚不能声称','Not established')],[[bi('分类器','Classifier'),bi('验证指标选 epoch10；测试 1,227 张，准确率 89.00%，平衡准确率 59.70%，宏 AUC 0.9687。','Validation selected epoch10; 1,227 test images, accuracy 89.00%, balanced accuracy 59.70%, macro AUC 0.9687.'),bi('总体准确率掩盖少数类；DF 测试召回 0/8，没有预测为 DF 的图片。','Overall accuracy masks minority classes; DF test recall is 0/8, with no DF predictions.')],[bi('源域概念','Source concepts'),bi('400 张训练，70 张保留验证；初始簇 807、31、11，最小成员规则后保留 1 个 32 维概念。','400 training and 70 held-out images; initial clusters of 807, 31, 11; one 32-dimensional concept retained by minimum size.'),bi('Completeness 0.6629 不证明病理覆盖；2,016 维补空间独立展示。','Completeness 0.6629 does not establish clinical coverage; the 2,016-dimensional complement is separate.')],[bi('外部迁移','External transfer'),bi('101 个 MEL 参考病例，无重拟合；296 片段中 259 有效、37 零特征；学习分配 94，补空间 165。','101 reference MEL cases, no refit; 259 valid and 37 zero-feature regions out of 296; 94 learned-concept and 165 complement assignments.'),bi('没有七类外部性能估计、临床语义或空间定位验证。','No seven-class external performance estimate, clinical-semantic or spatial-localization validation.')]])+figure('hub/figures/medical.png','源域 50/70 和外部 29/101 被预测为 MEL。不同队列与处理方式的差异不能归因为单一因素。','50/70 source held-out and 29/101 external cases were predicted as MEL. Differences in cohorts and processing cannot be attributed to one factor.')+h('优先核验什么','What to review first')+p('学习概念出现在外部 89/101 张图，平均选区 57.10%；大面积覆盖不证明对应病理结构。214 个相似候选对涉及 20 个病例，尚未人工判定；没有精确重复不代表没有近重复。分类错误已经出现在分割之前，不能全归因于概念发现。','The learned concept appears in 89/101 external cases, with mean selected area 57.10%; large coverage does not establish pathological identity. 214 similarity candidates involving 20 cases await review; no exact duplicates does not exclude near duplicates. Classification errors already occur before segmentation and cannot all be attributed to concept discovery.')+p('12 个预先约定的征象对照及 12 个独立补空间对照只作描述性关联。未新增 p 值、区间或方向翻转；其中两个对照仅 1 个阳性样本，结论不稳定。','Twelve prespecified sign contrasts and twelve separate complement contrasts are descriptive associations only. No new p values, intervals or direction reversals; two contrasts have only one positive and cannot support stable conclusions.','note')+'<div class="toc">'+link('workstreams/medical-external-results-20260923/concepts.html','外部概念与审阅','External concepts and review')+link('workstreams/medical-external-results-20260923/cases.html','全部 101 个病例','All 101 cases')+link('workstreams/medical-hm-results-20260922/index.html','分类器与相似图对','Classifier and similarity pairs')+link('workstreams/batch-review-20260922/medical.html','源域概念示例','Source concept examples')+'</div>'
page('medical.html',('皮肤影像：分类、概念与外部迁移','Dermatology: classification, concepts and external transfer'),body)
body=p('人工需要确认语义、样本身份和临床解释，不必重新手算所有已通过的数组检查。AI Inspection 属于探索性观察，不能替代人类实验。','Human review should address semantics, sample identity and clinical interpretation, rather than manually recomputing every accepted array check. AI inspection is exploratory, not a human study.','lead')+table([('对象','Object'),('为什么需要人工','Why human review'),('记录方式','What to record')],[[bi('高：概念语义与训练／验证一致性','High: concept semantics and train/validation consistency'),bi('数学分配没有语义标准答案，top 原型可能掩盖随机成员的差异。','Numerical assignment has no semantic ground truth; prototypes can hide random-member diversity.'),bi('简短描述、主体／部件／背景／混合、随机支持、例外及 ID。先看下方案例，再扩展全部概念。','Short description, object/part/background/mixed, random support, exceptions and IDs. Start below, then cover all concepts.')],[bi('高：医学相似图对','High: medical similarity pairs'),bi('相似度可能来自同一病灶或仅外观相似，近重复影响独立性。','Similarity can reflect the same lesion or merely similar appearance; near duplicates affect independence.'),bi('214 对 / 20 病例：同病灶证据、不同视角、处理重复及不确定项。','214 pairs / 20 cases: same-lesion evidence, alternate views, processing duplicates and uncertainty.')],[bi('高：医学概念与征象','High: medical concepts and signs'),bi('需要领域知识；全图标签关联不证明掩码定位了该征象。','Domain expertise is needed; image-label association does not show that masks localize a sign.'),bi('由合适领域审阅者标可见结构、选区是否包含结构、背景和伪影；允许不确定。','A domain reviewer should record visible structures, selected-region correspondence, background/artifacts and uncertainty.')],[bi('中：灰度筛选场景风险','Medium: grayscale scene-selection risk'),bi('已有老式车辆、飞机和役牛场景的定性观察，未系统对比彩色候选。','Vintage vehicles/aircraft and working-ox scenes were observed, without systematic comparison against color candidates.'),bi('先定义场景和抽样规则，再核验；少量例子不证明偏差。','Define scene categories and sampling rules first; a few examples do not establish bias.')]])+h('建议先看这些对照','Suggested starting contrasts')
