body+=h('审阅与统计边界','Review and statistical limits')+p('各条目保持“未审阅”，直到人工实际填写。157 条 AI 观察不是 157 个一致概念。若要统计比例，先固定范围、分母、标准、审阅者和分歧处理；当前表单不是论文 Table1 的人类指标。','Entries remain unreviewed until a person records a judgment. 157 AI observations do not mean 157 coherent concepts. Before computing proportions, fix scope, denominators, criteria, reviewers and disagreement handling; current forms do not yield paper Table1 human metrics.')+p('保留原存储键和概念 ID。更换浏览器或文件地址前先导出 JSON；报告不会把 AI 描述写成人工结论。','Original storage keys and concept IDs are preserved. Export JSON before changing browsers or file addresses; AI descriptions are not written as human judgments.','quiet')
page('human-review.html',('哪些结果需要人工校验','Which results need human review'),body)
body=p('论文的概念数量、预测影响、人类可理解性和输入处理消融是不同证据，不能互相替代。','Concept counts, prediction impact, human understandability and input-treatment ablations are distinct evidence and cannot substitute for each other.','lead')+table([('论文位置','Paper location'),('已完成','Completed'),('缺失与原因','Missing and why')],[[bi('§4；补充 Table2：概念发现','§4; Supplement Table2: discovery'),bi('十类固定 400/50，数量、过滤和覆盖度。','Ten fixed 400/50 sets, counts, filtering and completeness.'),bi('作者确切清单／种子未在已查材料找到，不能声称逐张一致。跳灰度和验证转换单独披露。','Exact author lists/seeds were not found in inspected materials, so image-wise identity is not claimed. Grayscale filtering and conversions are disclosed.')],[bi('Fig.3：概念示例','Fig.3: examples'),bi('全部概念、补空间、初始／最终、原型／随机／诊断。','All concepts, complements, initial/final and prototype/random/diagnostic views.'),bi('作者选例不是自动 top-K，同编号不表示同语义；人工对应待做。','Author examples are not automatic top-K; identical IDs do not mean identical semantics. Human matching remains undone.')],[bi('§4.2；Fig.4：四方法 500 张双向评价','§4.2; Fig.4: four-method, 500-image evaluation'),bi('HU-MCD＋Random 十类；MCD、ACE 仅 Golden。','HU-MCD + Random for ten classes; MCD and ACE only Golden.'),bi('九类 MCD／ACE 的 63 个阶段已提交，结果尚未验收，因此四方法十类对照未齐。本批已获授权，无需重复申请；ACE 协议限制保留。','The 63 stages for nine-class MCD/ACE are submitted but results are unaccepted, so the full comparison remains incomplete. This batch is already authorized; ACE limitations remain.')],[bi('§4.1；Table1：人类实验','§4.1; Table1: human study'),bi('仅 AI 观察与人工审阅表单。','AI observations and human-review forms only.'),bi('缺任务预测准确率、概念可辨认率、描述内／间相似度及统计检验。论文 41 位参与者，AI 名称不能充当人类回答。','Missing task-prediction accuracy, recognizability, within/between-description similarity and statistical tests. The paper used 41 participants; AI names cannot substitute for their responses.')],[bi('补充 Figs.6–7：输入处理消融','Supplement Figs.6–7: input ablation'),bi('固定主处理；边界扰动是另一问题。','Fixed main treatment; boundary sensitivity is a different question.'),bi('未做灰色背景替换、紧裁剪缩放。需冻结输入／特征／评价路径和预算，不能静默改主实验。','Grey-background replacement and tight-crop resizing remain undone. Freeze input/feature/evaluation paths and budget; do not silently change the main run.')],[bi('项目扩展：分割与医学','Project extensions: segmentation and medical'),bi('已有实际结果，分开报告。','Actual results reported separately.'),bi('仍缺完整扰动条件、医学专家语义／空间与身份核验；不是论文原有必备项。','Complete perturbation conditions, expert semantic/spatial review and identity checks remain; these are not original-paper requirements.')]])+h('建议顺序','Recommended order')+p('等待已提交九类 MCD／ACE 完成后统一验收；同步做预定义的小范围人工审阅，再设计正式人类实验；之后安排两种替代输入处理。分割故障定位和医学专家核验独立推进。','Accept the already-submitted nine-class MCD/ACE results after completion; conduct a prespecified small human review in parallel before designing the formal study; then plan alternative input treatments. Segmentation-failure diagnosis and medical expert review are independent tracks.')+p('本轮未提交新增实验。新增计算需具体协议、配置和预算获批。','No new experiments were submitted this round. New compute requires approval of concrete protocols, configurations and budgets.','note')+link('support/paper.pdf','本地论文 PDF','Local paper PDF')+' · '+link('support/supplement.pdf','补充 PDF','Supplement PDF')
page('paper-comparison.html',('与论文相比，还缺哪些实验','What remains to match the paper experiments'),body)
issues=[('REPORT26-001','过期评价标签','Stale evaluation labels','旧 atlas 标为未运行，但后续验收已完成。','Old atlas labels said not run, despite subsequent acceptance.','已改用验收状态表，科学结果未改。','Resolved using accepted status records; scientific results unchanged.'),('REPORT26-002','缩写冲突','Abbreviation collision','SSC 聚类算法与 benchmark 的小写 ssc 标识易混淆。','SSC clustering and the benchmark lowercase ssc flag are easily confused.','术语页已区分，界面使用评价全名。','Glossary distinguishes them; interface uses full evaluation names.'),('REPORT26-003','AI 观察缺项','Missing AI observations','原 157 条目仅 58 个有观察，本轮实际查看固定示例补齐 99 个。','Previously 58/157 entries had observations; 99 were completed by viewing fixed examples.','仅代表有限样本，人工状态不变。','Sample-limited observations; human status unchanged.'),('SCI-ZERO','零特征分配','Zero-feature assignments','发现排除零特征；原评价对 413/5687 零特征片段采用全零 argmax，分到首概念。','Discovery excludes zero features; the original benchmark assigns 413/5687 zero-feature regions to the first concept through an all-zero argmax tie.','已知规则差异可能影响区域与评价；保留行为，未做敏感性实验。','Known rule difference may affect masks/evaluation; behavior retained, no sensitivity study.'),('SCI-ACE','ACE 名义筛选','ACE nominal filtering','重复负样本、配对双侧检验；保留三概念均值低于对照。另有 SLIC 末标签遗漏和交叉熵梯度行为。','Repeated negatives and paired two-sided testing retain three concepts below control mean. Released code also omits the final SLIC label and uses cross-entropy gradients.','按批准参考协议保留；p 值不作独立重复的已校准证据，影响可能传递到筛选／评价。','Retained under approved reference protocol; p values are not calibrated independent-replicate evidence. Effects may reach filtering/evaluation.'),('SCI-MCD','MCD 空概念','MCD absent masks','43/50 图至少有一个缺失学习概念掩码；原 NaN 得分／跳过路径存在，最终预测有限。','43/50 images have an absent learned-concept mask; original NaN-score/skipping paths occur, with finite predictions.','贡献人数递减；只报已计算点，不补端点。','Contributors decrease; report computed points only, no endpoint filling.'),('SCI-INPUT','输入与筛选差异','Input and selection differences','训练 seed43 跳灰度补400；验证保留 ID，无损三通道转换 L 图。','Training seed43 skips grayscale to reach 400; validation IDs retained with lossless three-channel L-image conversion.','场景偏差是未验证风险，不是确定影响；作者确切清单未找到。','Scene bias is an unverified risk, not an established effect; exact author lists were not found.'),('SCI-ROBUST','扰动 batch 一致性','Perturbation batch consistency','四类 batch8→7 对照超特征容差，28 个已检查分配不变。','Four classes exceed feature tolerance in batch8→7 controls; 28 inspected assignments stay unchanged.','只验收已通过条件；浮点机制待定位，没有放宽门限或重提。','Only passed conditions accepted; arithmetic mechanism unresolved, no gate relaxation or retry.'),('SCI-MED-ID','医学身份独立性','Medical identity independence','无精确重复；214 相似对、20 病例未人工判定。','No exact duplicates; 214 similarity pairs involving 20 cases remain unreviewed.','近重复／同病灶风险未解除，不声称患者独立。','Near-duplicate/same-lesion risk remains; patient independence not established.'),('SCI-MED-SEM','医学语义与预测','Medical semantics and predictions','一学习概念；外部29/101 MEL预测、37/296零特征；两个征象对照只有1个阳性。','One learned concept; external 29/101 MEL predictions, 37/296 zero features; two sign contrasts have one positive.','临床语义／空间定位未验证，队列差值不是因果分解。','Clinical semantics/localization unvalidated; cohort differences are not a causal decomposition.'),('SCI-VISUAL','原型与随机成员','Prototypes and random members','固定样本有混杂，也有一致背景；初始／最终通常不是同一片段样本。','Fixed samples show mixtures and coherent backgrounds; initial/final groups generally contain different sampled segments.','内容范围扩大不证明某片段分配错误，需相同 ID 与交叉表。','Broader content does not establish a specific assignment error; match IDs and transition tables.')]
